				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "6a4891fc-cedd-575a-960b-252d7c3d6299")
	)
	(text "Jack LED: green anode via R950 to 3V3, cathode on PHY LED2 (3.3 V pin, active low with its CFG_LDO1\npull-up R928). Program LCR for link/activity."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 299.72 144.78 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "6b56f7d4-b614-52b2-9f55-c8b55e1c4c69")
	)
	(text "Straps 4k7: PHYAD = 001 (RXD3 up, RXC/RXCTL down), PLLOFF/TXDLY = 0, RXDLY = 1 (RX pins to DVDD_RG);\nCFG_EXT = 0 (LED0 down), CFG_LDO = 10 (LED1 down, LED2 up to 3V3) -> 1.8 V RGMII pads. MDIO/INT_N pull-ups."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 17.78 142.24 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "7c11664c-f57f-5503-b297-76a90cf9713d")
	)
